#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:5 6d0ad6a494f349b9a97b7780cdc56a49
msgid "Flight Options"
msgstr "飞行选项"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:8 8fb4f23032434306982c80938021db40
msgid ""
":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` is a bitmask that allows configuring "
"several alterations to Plane's behavior."
msgstr ":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>` 是一个位掩码，用于配置 Plane 多种行为的变更。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:12 cf04216afa564c4798031ebe0cb96050
msgid ":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>`"
msgstr ":ref:`FLIGHT_OPTIONS<FLIGHT_OPTIONS>`"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:12 0afc8ffff44d43c4b98f24b3cd1819ec
msgid "Function"
msgstr "功能"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:14 74c4495c18fd4b878c6210f392026031
msgid "0"
msgstr "0"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:14 e619c3555e254023948e05fa984ef381
msgid ""
"Allows rudder input to be used in only MANUAL, STABILIZE, and ACRO modes. In"
" VTOL modes, rudder input mixing can be controlled by the "
":ref:`STICK_MIXING<STICK_MIXING>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"仅允许在 MANUAL、Stabilize 和 ACRO 模式中使用方向舵输入。在 VTOL 模式中，方向舵输入混控可通过 "
":ref:`STICK_MIXING<STICK_MIXING>` 参数控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:15 e5d9d4d051634258a54cd1a2ba3f0594
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:15 049823f2446648e29a9ee876efb88372
msgid ""
"Forces center throttle stick to be :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` "
"instead of midway between :ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` and "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` when using an airspeed sensor in FBWB and "
"CRUISE modes."
msgstr ""
"在 FBWB 和 CRUISE 模式中使用空速传感器时，强制使油门摇杆中位对应 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`，而非 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>`"
" 和 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` 的中点。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:16 05a1b807128849bb854d22a070b1bd62
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:16 a7311a78059245c8b7ae8e149f55257e
msgid ""
"Disable the attitude checks for AUTOTAKEOFF and TAKEOFF mode start which "
"must be less than +/-30 degrees roll and 45 degrees pitch."
msgstr "禁用 AUTOTAKEOFF 和 TAKEOFF 模式启动时的姿态检查（要求横滚不超过正负 30 度、俯仰不超过 45 度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:17 67df7c9040a54ea881b8c1a7b737db5c
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:17 80d7261768f6415ea1cbb6c8c2bbb1c1
msgid ""
"Forces target airspeed to :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` in CRUISE "
"and FBWB modes when airspeed sensor is being used, ignoring throttle stick "
"position."
msgstr ""
"在使用空速传感器时，强制 CRUISE 和 FBWB 模式的目标空速为 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`，忽略油门摇杆位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:18 e767526b899d4dde9d5b3e4f8d6b6af0
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:18 962f961b36ef42b0a9f5ffaf636576a9
msgid ""
"Climb to :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` altitude before turning toward "
"home in RTL."
msgstr "在 RTL 中，先爬升到 :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE<RTL_ALTITUDE>` 高度，再转向 Home 点。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:19 6d7d973891dc4d3c9b409cf875d946b4
msgid "5"
msgstr "5"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:19 04c77f9f1aba440e87b3d3a4c4ea3343
msgid ""
"Enable :ref:`Yaw Damping Controller<yaw-controller-tuning>` to be active in "
"ACRO mode."
msgstr "启用 :ref:`偏航阻尼控制器<yaw-controller-tuning>` 在 ACRO 模式下保持激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:20 a120e2d0d2b24c15aed9488e5203f3cf
msgid "6"
msgstr "6"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:20 23c70bd303d0461ebd73e1e41dc8d344
msgid ""
"Suppress speed scaling during auto takeoffs to be 1 or less to prevent "
"oscillations when not using an airspeed sensor."
msgstr "在不使用空速传感器的自动起飞期间，将速度缩放因子限制在 1 以内，以防止震荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:21 a14de0218f84439d8b542b1881ea3dc3
msgid "7"
msgstr "7"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:21 68845545becf42a09a89d4dc244f057b
msgid "Enable default airspeed EKF fusion for takeoff (Advanced users only)."
msgstr "为起飞启用默认空速 EKF 融合（仅适用于高级用户）。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:22 f8996d22751f4f81b6b8e1feb3bd91a5
msgid "8"
msgstr "8"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:22 ead14bb32a0448e0bf82f30e7bafd044
msgid ""
"Remove :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` offset on the GCS horizon to show"
" pitch relative to AHRS trim (i.e. the attitude at which the autopilot was "
"calibrated, unless manually changed)."
msgstr ""
"在 GCS 地平线上移除 :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` 偏移，使俯仰显示相对于 AHRS "
"配平（即飞控校准时的姿态，除非手动更改）。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:23 57816c4571504ba19df1f054fe809b1d
msgid "9"
msgstr "9"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:23 f22ffed79e254bd39372bc9b85c6c10b
msgid ""
"Remove :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` on the OSD horizon to show pitch "
"relative to AHRS trim (i.e. the attitude at which the autopilot was "
"calibrated, unless manually changed)."
msgstr ""
"在 OSD 地平线上移除 :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` 偏移，使俯仰显示相对于 AHRS "
"配平（即飞控校准时的姿态，除非手动更改）。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:24 f7708f26e41b47879e4dec23b7bc119c
msgid "10"
msgstr "10"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:24 2a84271d4c9e426899b79672e79d4b15
msgid ""
"Adjust mid-throttle to be :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` in non-auto "
"throttle modes except MANUAL, instead of midway between MAX and MIN stick "
"values (note that the RCx_TRIM value for the throttle channel (x) MUST BE "
"set to center stick value)."
msgstr ""
"在非自动油门模式（除 MANUAL 外）中，将油门中位调整为 "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>`，而非最大与最小摇杆值的中点（注意：油门通道的 RCx_TRIM "
"值（x）必须设置为摇杆中位值）。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:25 37e68949044444dc990b793ff657bd8a
msgid "11"
msgstr "11"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:25 08f9a236b3f44be5bf1d23f6318830a8
msgid "Disable suppression of fixed wing rate gains in ground mode."
msgstr "在地面模式下禁用对固定翼速率增益的抑制。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:26 9bea83beb965482ba5bf94533569a2c6
msgid "12"
msgstr "12"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:26 7e0d147225c04d58acb3a3359bbfe66a
msgid "Enable FBWB style loiter altitude control if STICK_MIXING is enabled."
msgstr "若启用了 STICK_MIXING，则在 Loiter 模式中启用 FBWB 风格的高度控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:27 9d4b9884650747e19f9c9ac38f5c4518
msgid "14"
msgstr "14"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:27 63307c0902a244a18ad2b53470b8750b
msgid ""
"In AUTO, climb to next waypoint altitude immediately instead of linear "
"climb."
msgstr "在 AUTO 模式中，立即爬升到下一航点高度，而非线性爬升。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:30 705e686577384d3483847a44ef0ff203
msgid ""
"Default is no options enabled (\"0\"). Setting the bit will enable that "
"function. For example, if forcing target airspeed in FBWB and CRUISE modes "
"is desired, a value of \"8\" (bit 3 = 1) would be set."
msgstr ""
"默认不启用任何选项（「0」）。设置对应位将启用该功能。例如，若需在 FBWB 和 CRUISE 模式中强制目标空速，应将值设为「8」（第 3 位 = "
"1）。"

#: ../../source/docs/flight-options.rst:32 8c6e24a45a644cb5be9d58b442cc1855
msgid ""
"Normally, PTCH_TRIM_DEG is subtracted from the AHRS pitch so that the "
"artificial horizon shows pitch as if the autopilot was calibrated with "
"aircraft level position set at PTCH_TRIM_DEG instead of flat. This normally "
"results in the artificial horizon indicating 0 pitch when in cruise at "
"desired cruise speed. PTCH_TRIM_DEG is the pitch trim that would be required"
" in stabilized modes to maintain altitude at nominal cruise airspeed and "
"throttle, and for most planes is 1-3 degrees positive, depending on the "
"aircraft design (see :ref:`tuning-cruise`)."
msgstr ""
"通常，PTCH_TRIM_DEG 会从 AHRS 俯仰角中减去，使人工地平仪显示的俯仰角如同飞控是以 PTCH_TRIM_DEG "
"而非水平位置为水准校准一样。这通常使得飞机在期望巡航速度平飞时人工地平仪显示俯仰为 0。PTCH_TRIM_DEG "
"是在稳定模式下以标称巡航空速和油门维持高度所需的俯仰配平，对于大多数飞机而言为 1–3 度正值，具体取决于飞机设计（详见 :ref:`tuning-"
"cruise`）。"
